1
00:00:00,280 --> 00:00:02,230
(Amy:)I feel so bad
about lying to Sheldon.

2
00:00:02,382 --> 00:00:03,952
(Amy:)How am I gonna make it up to him?

3
00:00:04,117 --> 00:00:06,067
(Bernadette:)I'd tell you what I do with Howard,

4
00:00:06,219 --> 00:00:08,259
(Bernadette:)but I don't think dressing up
like a Catholic schoolgirl

5
00:00:08,422 --> 00:00:10,402
(Bernadette:)is gonna work with Sheldon.

6
00:00:14,294 --> 00:00:16,404
(Leonard:)He'd probably give you homework.

7
00:00:20,133 --> 00:00:23,043
(Amy:)-Did you lie to Howard about tonight?
-Of course.

8
00:00:23,203 --> 00:00:24,653
(Amy:)And you don't feel guilty about it?

9
00:00:24,805 --> 00:00:27,645
(Bernadette:)Between Penny's gorilla movie
and Howard's gorilla mother,

10
00:00:27,808 --> 00:00:29,408
(Bernadette:)I had no choice.

11
00:00:30,744 --> 00:00:33,484
(Leonard:)Thankfully, Penny and I have
a relationship based on honesty.

12
00:00:36,616 --> 00:00:37,996
(Leonard:)What?
I don't lie to her.

13
00:00:38,151 --> 00:00:40,431
(Bernadette:)Oh, we know you don't lie to her.

14
00:00:47,394 --> 00:00:48,494
(Leonard:)Thank you.

15
00:00:48,662 --> 00:00:52,012
(Penny:)Hey, maybe the answer to your
career question is in one of these.

16
00:00:52,165 --> 00:00:55,945
(Sheldon:)Penny, there's only one cookie
with something in the middle

17
00:00:56,103 --> 00:01:01,023
(Sheldon:)that solves life's problems,
and that's an Oreo.

